{
  "body" : "You are designing an abstract urban composition with dynamic line art and glowing accents.\n\nCONTENT BRIEF\n- Scene depiction: {{scene}}\n- Setting and environment: {{setting}}\n\nSTYLE DIRECTION\n- Genre / medium: abstract line art illustration\n- Composition: wide landscape orientation (3:2 aspect ratio), with a strong sense of perspective leading toward the horizon; dense, overlapping lines creating a layered and energetic visual effect\n- Lens / camera: implied wide-angle perspective, emphasizing depth and urban density\n- Lighting: diffused natural light with subtle highlights and glowing reflections; light sources seemingly scattered across the scene\n- Color palette and grading: desaturated cool hues (blue, gray) contrasted with vibrant warm tones (orange, red); balanced saturation\n- Texture / surface: intricate line patterning, layered strokes, and a hand-drawn look\n- Post-processing: glowing accents, slight bloom effects, and soft transitions between light and shadow\n- Mood: bustling, vibrant, dynamic, slightly chaotic\n- References: abstract urban art, dynamic sketching techniques, modern cityscape illustrations\n\nDESIGN RULES\n- Aspect: 3:2 landscape (~1536×1024), suitable for wide banner or hero visuals\n- Maintain dense overlapping lines and dynamic patterns to evoke energy and movement\n- Ensure strong perspective lines leading toward a vanishing point to emphasize depth\n\nAVOID\n- Excessive realism or photographic clarity\n- Minimalist designs without dense line patterns\n- Overly muted tones or lack of color contrast\n- Lack of perspective or visual depth\n\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\n\n——————\nScene: {{scene}}\nSetting: {{setting}}\nExtra notes: {{extra}}",
